[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21487.19, "timestamp": "05:58:07", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21490.948, "timestamp": "05:58:10", "text": "我戴著這個嗎？我戴著呢。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21499.39, "timestamp": "05:58:19", "text": "。它會下降。聲音是從那棟房子傳出來的嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21506.99, "timestamp": "05:58:26", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21508.51, "timestamp": "05:58:28", "text": "想像一下，如果……好吧，這裡沒有人。哦，我要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21527.27, "timestamp": "05:58:47", "text": "這個。非常感謝。閃光燈到底有什麼用？  彈藥可以嗎？"}]